## Scope and coverage

This semester request is ready for the finished Week 1 scope currently supported by notes. The ingestion pass covers futures basics (selected Chapter I, lecture and seminar) and course organization; later futures pricing, financial-contract examples, trading strategies, options and other syllabus weeks have no prepared academic notes in this course tree. They are uncovered semester topics, not completed curriculum. The hub confirms the course concerns futures/options and the theory/exercise exam format, but it does not supply their later explanations. This plan claims neither full-semester nor full-exam readiness. Deadline/retention horizon: null. Behavioral Economics is handled after the other semester courses, per the user's request.

