All five Markdown files in the enumerated course notes tree are selected; there are no additional Markdown candidates. Seven cited assets were inspected and included as required explanation dependencies. Topic maps and “What to carry forward” headings synthesize the covered rows; they do not create separate capabilities. Course communication, changeable meeting/exam dates, formula-list and calculator context remain in the hub for reference and are not factual recall targets or an inferred deadline. No learner evidence was present or created.

Source boundaries remain explicit: the own-broker/default wording is not an unlimited guarantee; variation margin has two source usages and targets/withdrawals are conditional; fractional quotation teaches arithmetic despite an instrument-label inconsistency; early hedge signed flow is −F0−B and positive cost F0+B; discounted value is the stated deferred-payment illustration, not daily-account value; finite long maximum needs a lower price bound; legal video labels have no supported explanation. These boundaries do not block their conditional prepared mechanisms. Clarification of exactly50 total points, live dates/rooms and actual broker policies belongs to the course team; no messages have been sent. Any request for the unsupported academic extensions requires ingest before plan can mark them ready.

